\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 2. Problem Statement\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Employees are expected to complete 
\f0\b 9 working hours
\f1\b0  each day. However:\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 Employees often don't know how many hours they've completed.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 There is no simple way to track daily work duration.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 Existing attendance systems are boring and feel like monitoring tools.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 Employees lack motivation to consistently complete their working hours.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1\fs26 HR reminders are reactive rather than proactive.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The goal is to create an engaging platform that helps employees 
\f0\b track
\f1\b0 , 
\f0\b visualize
\f1\b0 , and 
\f0\b complete
\f1\b0  their daily working hours through positive reinforcement and gamification.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 3. Vision\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Build a simple, modern, and engaging application that transforms daily work-hour tracking into a motivating experience using progress tracking, achievements, points, and friendly competition.\
The application should encourage consistency rather than enforce surveillance.\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

